---
/**
 * Terms of Use: requested by Compass compliance (2026-10) ahead of the
 * iHomeFinder property search. Kept out of the sitemap and noindexed, like
 * the Privacy Policy, until both are approved.
 */
import LegalDoc from '../components/LegalDoc.astro';
import Title from '../components/Title.astro';
import { agent, legal } from '../data/site';
import { withBase } from '../lib/paths';

const title = 'Terms of Use | David Weis';
const description = 'Terms of use for davidweis.com: informational purposes, property listing data, accounts, intellectual property, accessibility and fair housing.';
const updated = 'October 11, 2026';
---

<LegalDoc {title} {description} heading="Terms of Use" {updated}>
  <div class="pp__todo" slot="todo">
    <strong>Before launch:</strong> Have Compass compliance approve these terms, then remove this box.
    <ul>
      <li>[confirm: iHomeFinder's required IDX and MLS attribution wording, which may need to appear here or on the search pages]</li>
      <li>[confirm: the MLS names (for example SDMLS, CRMLS) to list once the search is live]</li>
      <li>[confirm: whether Compass wants its own terms linked from this page]</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <p class="lede lede--wide">These terms cover your use of davidweis.com. By using the site, you agree to them.</p>

  <h2>Acceptance</h2>
  <p>
    This website is operated by {agent.name}, a licensed real estate <Title /> in California (DRE #{agent.dre}), affiliated with
    {agent.brokerage} (DRE #{agent.brokerageDre}). If you do not agree with these terms, please do not use the site. Our
    <a href={withBase('/privacy-policy')}>Privacy Policy</a> explains how we handle your information.
  </p>

  <h2>Informational purposes, no advice</h2>
  <p>
    Everything on this site is general information. It is not legal, tax, financial or investment advice, and nothing here is an
    offer, a contract or a promise of any result. Talk to a qualified attorney, tax professional or lender about your situation, and
    verify anything that matters to you on your own, including prices, measurements, schools, zoning and permits.
  </p>

  <h2>Property listings and search data</h2>
  <p>
    Listing information comes from the multiple listing service (MLS) and other sources we believe are reliable, but it is not
    guaranteed. It can change or be withdrawn without notice, and it may be out of date. Square footage and other measurements are
    approximate.
  </p>
  <p>
    Listing data is provided for your personal, non-commercial use, to identify properties you may be interested in purchasing. You
    may not use it for any other purpose, or copy, scrape or resell it. Some listings may be held by brokerages other than
    {agent.brokerage}.
  </p>
  <p>{legal.disclaimer}</p>

  <h2>Accounts and saved searches</h2>
  <p>
    If you register for the property search to save searches or favorites, give us accurate information and keep your login private.
    You are responsible for activity under your account. We may close or restrict an account that is misused. You can ask us to
    delete your account at any time by emailing <a href={`mailto:${agent.email}`}>{agent.email}</a>. The property search is
    operated by iHomeFinder, and its handling of your information is described in our Privacy Policy.
  </p>

  <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>
    The photographs, copy, design and logos on this site belong to {agent.name}, {agent.brokerage} or the people who created or
    licensed them, and are protected by copyright and trademark law. You may not copy, republish or use them commercially without
    written permission. Compass, REALTOR®, the Equal Housing Opportunity logo and other third-party names and marks belong to their
    owners.
  </p>

  <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
  <p>
    The site links to other websites, including compass.com. We do not control them and are not responsible for their content or
    practices. A link is not an endorsement.
  </p>

  <h2>Accessibility</h2>
  <p>
    This site is built to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 at level AA, and works with a keyboard alone. If
    you find a barrier, email <a href={`mailto:${agent.email}`}>{agent.email}</a> with the page and what happened, and we will work
    to fix it and help you get the information another way.
  </p>

  <h2>Fair housing</h2>
  <p>
    We are committed to the Fair Housing Act and to equal housing opportunity for everyone, regardless of race, color, religion,
    sex, handicap, familial status, national origin or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local law. We aim
    to be accurate and honest in everything we publish about properties and services.
  </p>

  <h2>No unlawful use</h2>
  <p>
    Please do not use the site to break the law, interfere with how it works, try to get into systems or data you are not meant to
    reach, send spam, or collect information about other people.
  </p>

  <h2>Disclaimer of warranties and limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    The site and its content are provided "as is" and "as available," without warranties of any kind, express or implied. To the
    fullest extent the law allows, {agent.name} and {agent.brokerage} are not liable for indirect, incidental or consequential
    damages, or for losses that come from relying on the site's content or from the site being unavailable. Nothing here limits
    rights that cannot be limited under California law.
  </p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of California, without regard to its conflict of laws rules.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update these terms. The revised version will be posted here with a new "last updated" date. Continued use means you accept the changes.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    {agent.name}, <Title /> (DRE #{agent.dre})<br />
    {agent.brokerage} (DRE #{agent.brokerageDre}), {agent.office.street}, {agent.office.city}, {agent.office.state} {agent.office.zip}<br />
    <a href={`mailto:${agent.email}`}>{agent.email}</a> · <a href={agent.phoneHref}>{agent.phone}</a>
  </p>
</LegalDoc>
